From ac2d62c37baebe6d610bab3651ae74642bc76025 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 16:12:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] www: stop deriving the hero logo's width from its stretched
 height

The previous fix (a49fc57) moved .hero to grid and set the logo's
width via an auto column track sized from height:100%. That worked
in local testing but the report from a real browser run was that the
text block starts about half-way into the logo -- the auto column's
width was resolved from the SVG's pre-stretch intrinsic size (20px)
rather than the post-stretch rendered size, so the image overflowed
its column and the text column started underneath it. This is a
real, browser-dependent divergence: whether 'auto' track/flex-basis
sizing accounts for a stretched, aspect-ratio-derived replaced
element's final size instead of its intrinsic one isn't handled the
same way everywhere.

Removed that dependency entirely instead of chasing it further. The
logo's column now has a fixed width (66px, matching the image's
natural size at the intro block's typical height), and the image
fills that column with object-fit:contain, which needs no
stretch-vs-intrinsic resolution at all -- it just scales the image
to fit a box whose dimensions are already both known. The row's auto
height is then simply the max of the logo's own natural rendered
height and the text block's content height, so the logo still comes
out tip-to-tip with the text in the normal case, and in every case
(shorter or longer text) it degrades to being vertically centered in
its column rather than overlapping anything.
---
 scripts/www/index.html | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/scripts/www/index.html b/scripts/www/index.html
index 0d29c96..456ce75 100644
--- a/scripts/www/index.html
+++ b/scripts/www/index.html
@@ -24,9 +24,9 @@
            flex-wrap:wrap; }
   .brand { color:var(--sel); letter-spacing:.16em; font-size:15px; }
   .sub { color:var(--dim); font-size:11px; }
-  .hero { display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto 1fr; align-items:stretch;
+  .hero { display:grid; grid-template-columns:66px 1fr; align-items:stretch;
           gap:22px; margin-bottom:34px; }
-  .hero-logo { height:100%; width:auto; display:block; }
+  .hero-logo { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:contain; display:block; }
   .hero-text { display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; }
   .hero-name { display:block; font-size:24px; letter-spacing:.05em; color:var(--light);
                margin-bottom:6px; }
-- 
